# Build context for the root Dockerfile (the keith binary). It needs only
# the Go module: go.mod, go.sum and the packages under cmd/, internal/ and
# migrations/ (embedded SQL). Everything else stays out: .git, .claude
# worktrees, web/ and its node_modules, docs, prototypes, local env files
# and keys. Add a line here if a new top-level Go directory appears.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!migrations

# Never send secrets or local clutter, even from inside the dirs above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
internal/config/secrets
